    02_parts/*/part.yaml `mechanical.bottom_side_max_protrusion_mm`: THE SEATABILITY NUMBER, and the load-bearing key of this block. Tallest feature on the CARRIER-FACING face, so non-zero means the part cannot be reflowed flat — a POPULATION decision, not a footprint note. RP2040-Zero declares 1.000 (the 12 MHz crystal, MEASURED off the vendor STEP) and pluto-rx2-8way-v2's `assembly.yaml` carries the matching `not_assembled` entry for `U_MCU`, whose evidence opens "MECHANICAL, and MEASURED rather than argued". `assembly_coverage.py` grades that entry's SHAPE — reason inside the closed vocabulary, dated evidence, the ref off the CPL — and never that the reason is TRUE. The intended gate is the one that makes the two homes able to DISAGREE OUT LOUD
